{"about_the_game":"<br><br>&quot;Alchemist's Fantasy R ~ A Girl's Alchemic Furnace ~&quot; is an RPG game produced by \u307f\u3058\u3044\u3057 and published by Hanabi games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390000/extras/8af6ccc24f50e4c5ded082925c0cf216.avif?t=1700215942\" width=550 height=70 /></span><br>The young alchemist Meti from the village, along with her boyfriend Nero, begins a quest to find their missing master. Meti's ability to synthesize magical creatures helps the couple overcome various challenges they encounter on the way, and they discover a secret that changes their lives.<br>This game is a role-playing game featuring a turn-based combat system. It is characterized by a rich and immersive storyline, accompanied by excellent visual effects and atmospheric music. Players explore a vast world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390000/extras/53aeaa13a4714aa6940a70bce197cec1.avif?t=1700215942\" width=550 height=70 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390000/extras/1ed9ee421f092f177598860afd3c9381.avif?t=1700215942\" width=550 height=380 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390000/extras/3a68c335dc2868feb30756c135abf743.avif?t=1700215942\" width=550 height=380 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390000/extras/dfeca9f9641e64e073d5b62cc15a1704.avif?t=1700215942\" width=550 height=380 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2390000/extras/e01bef6a82c7d1f3c2126e4774036fe3.avi